  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC C SVA Improved Animal Health - PDC C SVA Improved Animal Heal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDC C SVA Improved Animal Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Partner Driven Cooperation to support &quot;Bilateral cooperation for improved animal health in Sweden and Vietnam via enhanced control of epizootic diseases&quot;. This project will be implemented by The National Veterinary Agency of Sweden (SVA) and the Department of Animal Health (DAH) Vietnam. The project focuses on creating cooperation between institutes, involving knowledge exchange in pig disease pathology.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akt&#xF6;rssamverkansprojekt f&#xF6;r att st&#xF6;dja det bilaterala samarbetet f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad djurh&#xE4;lsa i Sverige och Vietnam via st&#xE4;rkt kontroll av tillf&#xE4;lliga sjukdomar. Projektet implementeras av Statens Veterin&#xE4;rmedicinska Anstalt (SVA) och Departementet f&#xF6;r Djurh&#xE4;lsa (DAH) under Ministeriet f&#xF6;r jordbruk och landsbygdsutveckling i Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
